window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>If no one knows that you saved the world, does it really count?</p> <p>Eight years ago the world almost ended and Max lost everything, accused of betrayal and failure.</p> <p>Now working as a Marshal, keeping the city and its people safe from supernatural dangers, Max thinks she's broken all ties to her past. She's just trying to do her job and live her life.</p> <p>Asked to help local law enforcement with a series of vicious murders, Max is willing to assist but soon realises that she might be next. Can she keep her secret while finding the killer?</p>"; 
